<Base title="Colophon"><article class="simple-page shell"><p class="eyebrow">About this website</p><h1>A small, static notebook.</h1><p>This is the personal website of Khalil Ben Maaoui. The profile and professional experience are based on the CV provided for this site. Project descriptions follow the public repositories and distinguish working features from proposed extensions.</p><h2>Built to stay simple</h2><p>Astro generates static HTML from page components and Markdown. JavaScript is limited to the mobile navigation, article filtering, and the copy-link control. There are no accounts, analytics scripts, tracking cookies, or contact-form database.</p><h2>Illustrations</h2><p>The application screenshots and original ERD artwork come from the public job-scheduler repository. The class architecture is redrawn from its implemented architecture documentation; the styled ERD is generated from a snapshot of its actual SQLAlchemy models. Source links accompany the diagrams. Professional-work photographs are credited on their corresponding Work pages.</p><h2>Maintaining the notebook</h2><p>Articles live as Markdown files in the website repository. Adding a post and rebuilding updates the writing archive, homepage, RSS feed, and sitemap. The source is prepared for both root-domain hosting and a GitHub Pages project path.</p></article></Base>
